WEBVTT

00:10:58.987 --> 00:11:00.197
and this is way cheaper.

00:11:00.197 --> 00:11:01.490
(Laughter)

00:11:01.532 --> 00:11:04.034
But also because I just experienced

00:11:04.076 --> 00:11:08.372
one of the most notorious boys' clubs ever
in late-night television.

00:11:08.789 --> 00:11:11.208
And I'm here to offer solutions.

00:11:11.959 --> 00:11:14.712
I don't always follow up
a venting session with solutions,

00:11:14.712 --> 00:11:16.672
but when I do, it’s a TED Talk.

00:11:16.672 --> 00:11:18.340
(Laughter)

00:11:18.382 --> 00:11:19.550
That's right.

00:11:19.591 --> 00:11:23.137
(Applause)

00:11:23.178 --> 00:11:26.682
You see, my goal was always
a seat at the table.

00:11:26.974 --> 00:11:30.853
It's what women are conditioned
to believe success is.